        <mxCell id="hDetail" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#534AB7;" value="模型内部处理（关键公式，从左到右；仅机制，非实验验证）" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="1400" x="36" y="458" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="det0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFAFF;strokeColor=#AFA9EC;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2C2C2A;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;① 原始配对差&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$$\Delta A_{\ell,p}=A^{+}_{T,\ell}(p)-A^{-}_{T,\ell}(p),\quad p\in S_f,\quad \theta_0\ \text{stopgrad}$$" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="760" x="40" y="492" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="det1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFAFF;strokeColor=#AFA9EC;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2C2C2A;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;② 逐分量 patch 因果效应&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$$\mathrm{Eff}_{r_f}(\ell,p)=r_{f,p}\!\left(\mathrm{PatchFwd}(\theta_0;h\mapsto h+\Delta A_{\ell,p})\right)-r_{f,p}\!\left(\mathrm{Fwd}(\theta_0)\right)$$&lt;br&gt;$$\mathrm{Eff}_{U}(\ell,p)=U\!\left(\mathrm{PatchFwd}(\theta_0;h\mapsto h+\Delta A_{\ell,p})\right)-U\!\left(\mathrm{Fwd}(\theta_0)\right)$$" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="760" x="824" y="492" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="det2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFAFF;strokeColor=#AFA9EC;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2C2C2A;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;③ 因果门控权重&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$$w_{\ell,p}=\sigma\!\left(\frac{-\mathrm{Eff}_{r_f}(\ell,p)-\eta_f}{t_f}\right)\cdot\sigma\!\left(\frac{\eta_U-|\mathrm{Eff}_{U}(\ell,p)|}{t_U}\right),\quad \Delta A^{\text{causal}}_{\ell,p}=w_{\ell,p}\Delta A_{\ell,p}$$" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="760" x="1608" y="492" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="det3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFAFF;strokeColor=#AFA9EC;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2C2C2A;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;④ 中性可行集投影&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$$\mathcal K=\{h:\ r_{f,p}(h)\le c,\ s_{d_j,p}(h)\le d_j,\ \lVert\Delta r_{E,p}(h)\rVert\le e\}$$&lt;br&gt;$$T_{\ell,p}=\operatorname{stopgrad}\!\left(\Pi_{\mathcal K}\!\left[h^{+}_{\ell}(p)-\alpha\widehat{\Delta A^{\text{causal}}_{\ell,p}}\right]\right)$$" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="760" x="40" y="756" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="det4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFAFF;strokeColor=#AFA9EC;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2C2C2A;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤ 损失 / 反传 / 输出&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$$\mathcal{L}_F(k)=\frac{1}{|\Lambda(k)||S_f|}\sum_{\ell\in\Lambda(k)}\sum_{p\in S_f}\rho_\ell(k)\operatorname{dist}\!\left(h_{S,\ell}(p),T_{\ell,p}\right)$$&lt;br&gt;$$\mathcal{L}=\lambda_F\mathcal{L}_F+\beta\mathcal{L}_R,\quad \nabla_{\theta}\mathcal{L}\ \text{更新}\ \theta,\quad \Rightarrow\theta^{*}$$" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="760" x="824" y="756" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
